Base container image
--------------------

The Docker image is built FROM hotio/base (https://github.com/hotio/base),
which is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 (GPL-3.0).

hotio/base is used as an unmodified base image: dinoga adds its own files and
s6-overlay services on top (including its own /app/forwarded_port_update_app
hook, which hotio/base ships as an empty placeholder for exactly this purpose)
and does not modify hotio/base's own scripts or services. hotio/base and
dinoga's Go binary are separate works aggregated in one image, so the GPL-3.0
under which hotio/base is distributed does not extend to dinoga's own Go
sources, which remain GPL-2.0-only.

hotio/base's source code and its GPL-3.0 licence are available at:
https://github.com/hotio/base